---
profile: production
offline: true
skip_list:
  # Shared task files and cross-role facts (steward_uids) intentionally use
  # their own prefixes.
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
  # SSH and firewall changes are applied inline, armed with a rollback timer and
  # proven by a new connection before the play continues. A handler would run
  # too late for that sequence.
  - no-handler
